OL,3,AMan loses case to claw back $369,000 he
OL,4,Aspent on lavish gifts for ex-girlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Singaporean man has lost a court case
OL,7,Fto claw back hundreds of thousands of
OL,8,Fdollars that he had lavished on his
OL,9,Fex-girlfriend while they were together.
OL,11,FThe S$468,000 ($369,200; #273,260) that
OL,12,FChander Agarwal attempted to recover
OL,13,Ffrom Felicia Lee was money he had
OL,14,F"willingly" spent on her, the Singapore
OL,15,FHigh Court ruled.
OL,17,FAgarwal "displayed a consistent pattern
OL,18,Fof showering [Lee] with lavish gifts"
OL,19,Feven before they got together and would
OL,20,Freassure her that he did not expect
OL,21,Frepayment, Senior Judge Lee Seiu Kin
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
