OL,3,AMan loses case to claw back $369,000 he
OL,4,Aspent on lavish gifts for ex-girlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAgarwal, the CEO of a logistics
OL,7,Fcompany, met Felicia Lee, a former
OL,8,Fflight attendant, during a flight in
OL,9,F2019. They were in a romantic
OL,10,Frelationship from September 2022 to
OL,11,FDecember 2023, the court heard.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
